     &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Form.Item</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"邮箱\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> rules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">{[{ type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">'email'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">, message: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">'邮箱格式不正确'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> }]}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">          &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Input</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> placeholder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"非必填，填写后校验格式\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Form.Item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\"> htmlType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"submit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>校验并提交&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">Form</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        校验结果：&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">>{</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1\">result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">()}&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A\">span</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">DemoSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>"
